1
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:12,770
I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince

2
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:12,770
so I Can Take My Time
Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season

3
00:01:42,780 --> 00:01:48,380
Magnificent... It's like I have yet 
to glimpse the end of your potential.

4
00:01:48,910 --> 00:01:50,550
Likewise.

5
00:01:51,050 --> 00:01:52,510
Show me everything.

6
00:01:52,900 --> 00:01:57,010
There is one thing I can say for certain.

7
00:01:58,020 --> 00:02:01,020
The one advantage I have when facing you...

8
00:02:02,350 --> 00:02:04,600
is my greater variety of options.

9
00:02:11,620 --> 00:02:14,060
<i>This damned pig has gotten harder again.</i>

10
00:02:17,740 --> 00:02:22,710
Episode 21: The Moon and Tonkatsu

11
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:21,950
Hey! Quit outshining me!

12
00:02:21,950 --> 00:02:23,450
Now's not the time!

13
00:02:23,750 --> 00:02:26,220
Stay focused. 
He's going to regenerate again.

14
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:29,070
Damn it! Which part will 
it be from this time?

15
00:02:36,830 --> 00:02:39,570
Let's go over what we know...

16
00:02:39,570 --> 00:02:40,970
I'd rather not.

17
00:02:41,220 --> 00:02:43,800
First, this pig is immortal.

18
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,980
You can cut its head off, crush its heart,

19
00:02:45,980 --> 00:02:48,670
but it will regenerate 
from some random piece.

20
00:02:48,670 --> 00:02:50,790
And every time, it gets stronger.

21
00:02:50,790 --> 00:02:52,740
I said I didn't wanna hear it!

22
00:02:53,170 --> 00:02:56,760
At first, a single blow from Rozelis 
was enough to take its head off.

23
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:59,550
But now it takes all three 
of us, working together...

24
00:02:59,890 --> 00:03:02,770
The more it dies, the stronger it gets?

25
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:09,210
I Was Reincarnated as an Edible Orc so I 
Can Take My Time Annihilating Humanity.

26
00:03:18,130 --> 00:03:22,680
I Was Reincarnated as an Edible Orc

27
00:03:18,130 --> 00:03:22,680
so I Can Take My Time Annihilating Humanity

28
00:03:21,230 --> 00:03:23,550
No, no, no!

29
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:27,810
The Pope's Forces SSS-Rank Chimera

30
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:27,810
Mega Meat

31
00:03:25,010 --> 00:03:27,810
I'm not really sure what my deal is.

32
00:03:27,810 --> 00:03:30,820
Even my master doesn't seem to understand.

33
00:03:30,820 --> 00:03:34,060
<i>This chimera wasn't made by the Pope?</i>

34
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:37,320
And that's none of your business anyway.

35
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:41,360
Pork Punch!

36
00:03:49,550 --> 00:03:51,580
<i>Here we go again...</i>

37
00:04:00,150 --> 00:04:01,590
Die.

38
00:04:01,590 --> 00:04:03,090
Babylon!

39
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:07,930
Before you kill me, I need to know...

40
00:04:08,290 --> 00:04:11,480
Why do you hate humans so much?

41
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:13,850
I want to know your reasoning.

42
00:04:15,180 --> 00:04:18,850
You're that interested in my history?

43
00:04:18,850 --> 00:04:21,250
Sure! Tell us all about it!

44
00:04:21,250 --> 00:04:22,940
No, not really—

45
00:04:23,620 --> 00:04:29,860
We're bishops. It's part of our job to 
offer righteous guidance to lost lambs.

46
00:04:30,130 --> 00:04:33,630
Suit yourselves. 
Let's see if you can guide me...

47
00:04:34,490 --> 00:04:37,220
It all started a few years ago.

48
00:04:38,370 --> 00:04:42,370
I was created by a certain alchemist.

49
00:04:43,610 --> 00:04:45,380
At long last!

50
00:04:45,380 --> 00:04:48,530
I, the brilliant Ouroboro's 
greatest work is completed!

51
00:04:48,530 --> 00:04:51,400
A source of infinite pork, 
no matter how much you eat!

52
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:54,060
Ouroboro Number 6!

53
00:04:54,390 --> 00:04:56,520
Time for a taste test!

54
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:05,560
Incredible! I cut and I cut and 
it just grows back! Huge success!

55
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:07,910
Not only that, but the main 
body seems to have grown, too!

56
00:05:08,900 --> 00:05:12,160
You're going to save people 
across the world from famine...

57
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:15,670
We'll rename you Mega Meat, 
as you begin your ascent to fame!

58
00:05:15,700 --> 00:05:17,160
Ba-dump...

59
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,300
I was happy.

60
00:05:19,750 --> 00:05:22,510
Happy about being able to 
help people, with my body.

61
00:05:22,990 --> 00:05:26,230
And that my creator was so happy...

62
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:30,580
Oh, hell no! That's not edible at all!

63
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:32,430
Until that moment!

64
00:05:35,090 --> 00:05:38,250
Number 6!

65
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:44,130
After that, I went around 
feeding my flesh to humans.

66
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:48,280
But they all puked... 
and after the hundredth spew,

67
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:52,220
around that time people were spreading 
rumors of the monstrous pig man...

68
00:05:53,210 --> 00:05:54,860
That's when I realized something.

69
00:05:56,020 --> 00:05:58,190
I tasted bad!

70
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:01,380
You people could never understand...

71
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:04,260
I was born to be eaten,

72
00:06:04,260 --> 00:06:07,960
but tasted so incredibly bad 
that even flies would turn away...

73
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:14,690
And as I was sinking into despair, 
I encountered my master.

74
00:06:24,150 --> 00:06:25,730
Chomp

75
00:06:30,290 --> 00:06:32,160
Magnificent.

76
00:06:32,410 --> 00:06:37,130
Ba-dump...

77
00:06:33,210 --> 00:06:37,670
I can feel your flesh's potential 
for infinite regeneration.

78
00:06:37,670 --> 00:06:41,910
Yet at the same time, 
it does have an odd taste.

79
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:45,670
Your power should not be 
used for the sake of man.

80
00:06:45,670 --> 00:06:49,680
It is a weapon, that should be used against 
the people who treated you like livestock...

81
00:06:49,940 --> 00:06:52,890
Do you really intend on 
letting their egotistic aims

82
00:06:52,890 --> 00:06:55,790
sully the proud, rich, 
monstrous bloodlines you embody?

83
00:06:55,790 --> 00:06:57,510
He had a point.

84
00:06:57,510 --> 00:07:01,200
And when he pointed it out, 
I was pissed off.

85
00:07:04,380 --> 00:07:06,700
<i>I can't think of anything to say to him...</i>

86
00:07:06,700 --> 00:07:08,910
I'm going to take vengeance

87
00:07:08,910 --> 00:07:12,440
on all of humanity, who has 
the nerve to say I taste bad!

88
00:07:14,950 --> 00:07:20,710
I Switched Jobs and Found My Guild Was in Dire Straights so Now I'm Really in Trouble!

89
00:07:22,300 --> 00:07:29,010
I Switched Jobs and Found My Guild Was

90
00:07:22,300 --> 00:07:29,010
in Dire Straights so Now I'm Really in Trouble!!

91
00:07:25,590 --> 00:07:26,800
Knock it off!

92
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,990
Stop making this conversation 
even more absurd!

93
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:33,510
Sorry

94
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:33,510
Doesn't
talk

95
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:33,510
Poisonous

96
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:33,510
Keeps adopting
new friends

97
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:33,510
Big
eater

98
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:33,510
Drunk

99
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:33,510
The Lovable Scamps

100
00:07:29,830 --> 00:07:33,500
Back in the day, it felt like I was 
living on the edge all the time...

101
00:07:34,140 --> 00:07:36,800
I'd wander the woods in search of food,

102
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:38,510
Is this edible?

103
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:39,210
Stretching what little money we 
had as far as it would go...

104
00:07:39,210 --> 00:07:43,760
Searching everywhere I could for a 
job to earn us some money for food.

105
00:07:39,930 --> 00:07:41,500
Better eat the skin...

106
00:07:40,060 --> 00:07:43,780
Better eat the skin...

107
00:07:44,010 --> 00:07:46,840
If I had met you back then,

108
00:07:47,610 --> 00:07:51,040
I probably would've taken you into my arms.

109
00:07:51,610 --> 00:07:52,280
Ba-dump...

110
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:54,190
D-Don't be stupid!

111
00:07:54,190 --> 00:07:57,170
You're only saying that because 
you don't know how nasty I taste!

112
00:07:59,430 --> 00:08:05,280
I'll make you into the kind of pork 
dish the entire world will love!

113
00:08:05,540 --> 00:08:07,340
Ba-doink

114
00:08:08,930 --> 00:08:11,750
What exactly is going on here?

115
00:08:12,070 --> 00:08:16,110
The world's turned monochrome from 
how little hope I have left.

116
00:08:16,110 --> 00:08:18,270
Thinking's a dead end, Rozelis.

117
00:08:18,820 --> 00:08:22,150
If we can't beat our opponent physically,

118
00:08:22,150 --> 00:08:26,180
the only choice is to cook him up 
tastily so he'll change his ways!

119
00:08:26,530 --> 00:08:30,020
Hang on, Thor... you say that, but...

120
00:08:30,020 --> 00:08:34,530
How is it possible to cook food with 
that purple aura into anything tasty?!

121
00:08:34,530 --> 00:08:38,910
We need to save his soul
so we need to eat with all we've got!

122
00:08:38,910 --> 00:08:41,290
So we're stuck as the taste testers?!

123
00:08:41,530 --> 00:08:43,900
<i>I don't know what you think you're doing,</i>

124
00:08:43,900 --> 00:08:47,290
<i>but you'll see soon enough</i>

125
00:08:47,290 --> 00:08:49,540
<i>just how terrifying my 
uncookable meat is!</i>

126
00:08:49,540 --> 00:08:50,540
Dink

127
00:08:50,540 --> 00:08:53,080
Did you hear that dink?!
That meat's not frozen, is it?!

128
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,460
It's freshly cut, isn't it?!

129
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:57,290
Quit freaking out! 
You're making me scared, too!

130
00:08:57,290 --> 00:09:00,680
<i>That's right. Before anything 
else, my meat is hard.</i>

131
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:04,380
<i>What could a cook with 
your skills possibly do?</i>

132
00:09:05,050 --> 00:09:09,490
Relax. I already know how to 
deal with this tough slab.

133
00:09:09,490 --> 00:09:10,560
<i>What?!</i>

134
00:09:10,810 --> 00:09:14,560
You can't beat it tender. 
You need the opposite approach, in fact.

135
00:09:14,810 --> 00:09:16,640
Gently stroke it...

136
00:09:15,650 --> 00:09:17,570
Stroke

137
00:09:18,860 --> 00:09:23,040
What are you doing?! There's no way 
you can soften meat like that!

138
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,450
No, look!

139
00:09:24,450 --> 00:09:27,960
Flop...

140
00:09:24,690 --> 00:09:26,810
The meat's gone downright 
floppy, it's so soft!

141
00:09:26,810 --> 00:09:27,950
How?!

142
00:09:27,950 --> 00:09:32,280
You evolved in a way where, the more you're 
killed, the harder your flesh became.

143
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:35,220
I figured the trick would be 
to get that flesh to regress.

144
00:09:35,740 --> 00:09:38,760
Sorry for attacking you so senselessly.

145
00:09:39,310 --> 00:09:42,990
But it's okay now. You can relax.

146
00:09:44,780 --> 00:09:46,220
<i>Impossible!</i>

147
00:09:46,490 --> 00:09:50,680
<i>Did that slab really give in? 
Am I really that easy?!</i>

148
00:09:52,730 --> 00:09:58,600
<i>Well, as much as I'd like to praise you 
for getting past how tough my meat is...</i>

149
00:10:01,030 --> 00:10:03,730
What are you doing now, Babylon?

150
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:07,240
<i>There's more to how unappetizing I am.</i>

151
00:10:07,560 --> 00:10:10,580
<i>Specifically, how gamy it is.</i>

152
00:10:10,990 --> 00:10:14,000
<i>There was one chef who tried 
to get rid of the aroma...</i>

153
00:10:14,770 --> 00:10:18,010
<i>The resulting smell was bad enough 
to shutter his restaurant!</i>

154
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:21,760
<i>There's no seasoning or chef capable...</i>

155
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:27,630
<i>of overcoming it!</i>

156
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:28,860
Pork...

157
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:34,140
I think... I'll call this dish... Tonkatsu.

158
00:10:34,430 --> 00:10:36,150
Well I don't-katsu think you'll win!

159
00:10:36,150 --> 00:10:38,830
As much as I hate to admit it...

160
00:10:38,830 --> 00:10:42,160
It looks so crispy, fried, and delicious...

161
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:44,070
Downright colorful.

162
00:10:44,410 --> 00:10:46,330
Let's see you eat it then!

163
00:10:46,330 --> 00:10:48,670
And if you're able to 
choke it down without puking,

164
00:10:49,150 --> 00:10:51,880
I'll reconsider my revenge on mankind.

165
00:10:54,260 --> 00:10:57,240
Listen up, just swallow 
it without chewing much.

166
00:10:57,240 --> 00:11:01,790
<i>It's pointless. I bet you think that 
batter will conceal the gaminess.</i>

167
00:11:01,790 --> 00:11:04,210
<i>But it's going to have the opposite affect.</i>

168
00:11:04,210 --> 00:11:08,130
<i>Once the crust is cracked open, 
the aroma will burst forth,</i>

169
00:11:05,350 --> 00:11:07,370
Let's go on three.

170
00:11:07,370 --> 00:11:09,060
On three, then...

171
00:11:08,130 --> 00:11:11,350
<i>and once you're caught in it, 
you'll be barfing up a storm!</i>

172
00:11:11,870 --> 00:11:12,760
Chew.

173
00:11:18,410 --> 00:11:22,190
<i>I can't stop chewing it! 
What a delightful texture!</i>

174
00:11:22,540 --> 00:11:27,190
<i>We're bishops, yet we're possessed with 
an inter-mouth impulse for destruction!</i>

175
00:11:27,190 --> 00:11:30,450
<i>And it leaves the mischievous priests we've 
been turned into with only one option...</i>

176
00:11:27,540 --> 00:11:30,070
Look! Let's go swimming!

177
00:11:30,450 --> 00:11:32,950
<i>to dive in!</i>

178
00:11:33,290 --> 00:11:38,710
<i>Into this overflowing stream 
of savory juiciness!</i>

179
00:11:38,710 --> 00:11:41,800
Delicious!

180
00:11:42,590 --> 00:11:44,900
Impossible! There's no way that's true!

181
00:11:44,900 --> 00:11:46,470
But it really is!

182
00:11:46,470 --> 00:11:50,020
It's like every bite spurs 
more flavor out of the meat!

183
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:54,750
What the hell did you do?

184
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:57,230
During the prep stage...

185
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:59,790
I added a handful of Glow.

186
00:12:01,990 --> 00:12:03,700
Fresh...

187
00:12:03,380 --> 00:12:05,980
What a delicious-looking 
cut of pork sirloin!

188
00:12:05,980 --> 00:12:10,490
It's said that advanced enough purification 
can turn gutter water pristine...

189
00:12:10,490 --> 00:12:13,990
Babylon! Your divine sorcery is brilliant!

190
00:12:13,990 --> 00:12:16,500
I definitely wouldn't call it brilliant.

191
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:18,630
I only shone the faintest
bit of light on it.

192
00:12:19,140 --> 00:12:20,660
Which made it clear...

193
00:12:21,470 --> 00:12:25,010
Mega Meat, you're a good guy.

194
00:12:26,580 --> 00:12:30,840
You dedicated your existence to others, 
while beset on all sides by despair...

195
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:32,800
That's where that nasty taste stems from.

196
00:12:33,230 --> 00:12:36,400
But my Glow was enough to 
wash it away, with ease.

197
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:38,800
That shows the kind of softy you are...

198
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,440
Mommy, something smells good!

199
00:12:39,970 --> 00:12:42,700
You should live how you want to, Mega Meat.

200
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:44,900
Who would be cooking at a time 
like this, instead of evacuating?

201
00:12:43,170 --> 00:12:44,910
But never forget...

202
00:12:47,910 --> 00:12:50,150
Delicious!

203
00:12:50,150 --> 00:12:52,920
...humans love you.

204
00:12:54,880 --> 00:12:57,090
It doesn't matter how mad I get...

205
00:12:57,870 --> 00:13:01,910
Whenever I see this sight, 
I just have to let it go.

206
00:13:02,860 --> 00:13:04,800
Thank you for the food!

207
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:08,000
Be sure to take some to the shelter!

208
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,680
<i>This meat really is incredible!</i>

209
00:13:15,950 --> 00:13:17,930
<i>Once I start selling 
Rozelis-branded Mega Meat,</i>

210
00:13:17,930 --> 00:13:21,690
<i>I'll have solved famines around the 
globe, and won hordes of converts!</i>

211
00:13:21,690 --> 00:13:23,010
That settles it!

212
00:13:23,010 --> 00:13:24,870
Let me take care of this pig—

213
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:26,700
Babylon was your name, right?

214
00:13:29,770 --> 00:13:33,700
I want you to purify me.

215
00:13:33,700 --> 00:13:35,760
Hang on, Mega Meat!

216
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:40,210
I get the feeling your regeneration 
is tied to your anger and hatred.

217
00:13:40,210 --> 00:13:43,170
Purify that, and you might 
just be an ordinary pig!

218
00:13:43,170 --> 00:13:44,370
It'd be such a waste...

219
00:13:44,370 --> 00:13:45,710
I know.

220
00:13:46,090 --> 00:13:50,690
I will no longer be infinite. 
It might reduce me to a single serving.

221
00:13:51,620 --> 00:13:55,330
But I want to be eaten, at my tastiest...

222
00:13:56,450 --> 00:13:58,720
by you, Babylon.

223
00:14:01,700 --> 00:14:03,690
<i>Forgive me, Master.</i>

224
00:14:04,350 --> 00:14:05,980
<i>Professor Ouroboro.</i>

225
00:14:06,590 --> 00:14:09,730
<i>But I want to live for the sake of others!</i>

226
00:14:10,040 --> 00:14:12,810
<i>I won't be saving everyone 
in the world from hunger...</i>

227
00:14:13,380 --> 00:14:15,120
The gaminess... is going away...

228
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:17,000
The flavor!

229
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:20,250
<i>But I'll be going into the stomach of 
the only person to ever understand me!</i>

230
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:22,720
<i>I...</i>

231
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:35,500
I guess that's it. 
I made a promise after all...

232
00:14:40,090 --> 00:14:43,470
Damn it! There's no way I can eat you!

233
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,990
Mega Meat (The Endless No. 6)

234
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,990
Joined the party.

235
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:51,920
I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince

236
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:51,920
so I Can Take My Time
Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season

237
00:15:12,890 --> 00:15:14,650
It's really quite impressive.

238
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:19,020
Luxa should be more than capable of 
slicing through that candelabra...

239
00:15:20,070 --> 00:15:23,250
But in your hands, 
that seems to not be the case.

240
00:15:24,190 --> 00:15:26,800
Almost like sorcery.

241
00:15:28,180 --> 00:15:30,820
I'm only asking to confirm...

242
00:15:31,090 --> 00:15:34,370
You're not also the mysterious 
pastor, are you?

243
00:15:34,870 --> 00:15:39,370
The mysterious pastor? Oh, not at all.

244
00:15:39,950 --> 00:15:43,960
My master stands at heights 
far beyond my reach.

245
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:50,840
Despite being a bishop, 
your swordplay lives up to its reputation.

246
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:56,970
I can't deny being curious about this 
master of which you speak so highly.

247
00:15:57,490 --> 00:16:01,470
Your reputation precedes you 
as well, Silver Blader.

248
00:16:02,050 --> 00:16:07,350
Something about leaving the field as soon 
as you became an A-Rank adventurer.

249
00:16:08,450 --> 00:16:11,990
Why choose to become a maid, instead?

250
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:16,330
You don't have to answer if you don't—

251
00:16:16,330 --> 00:16:17,730
Because I met...

252
00:16:18,860 --> 00:16:22,760
someone I was fated to stand beside.

253
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:25,000
<i>Well, that was certainly 
not the answer I expected.</i>

254
00:16:27,510 --> 00:16:31,000
It seems as if neither 
of us can lose, then...

255
00:16:31,420 --> 00:16:32,880
For the sake of those we serve.

256
00:16:34,390 --> 00:16:36,760
Luxa: Lunar Spectrum.

257
00:16:37,570 --> 00:16:38,890
<i>Rainbow-colored smoke?!</i>

258
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,710
Midnight Sun.

259
00:16:41,550 --> 00:16:43,060
Fickle Fog!

260
00:16:43,740 --> 00:16:45,900
<i>And a circle of rainbow-colored giants?</i>

261
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:48,430
<i>No. Don't fall for it.</i>

262
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:51,010
<i>This is just that phenomenon 
seen at high altitudes,</i>

263
00:16:51,010 --> 00:16:53,400
<i>an interaction of light and shadow.</i>

264
00:16:53,750 --> 00:16:56,400
<i>In other words, it's no threat!</i>

265
00:17:00,030 --> 00:17:03,640
<i>That wasn't a shadow. 
Then is all of this mist her Luxa?!</i>

266
00:17:07,180 --> 00:17:09,170
<i>There're too many strikes aimed at me.</i>

267
00:17:09,170 --> 00:17:10,910
<i>It's not giving me time to focus on defense,</i>

268
00:17:10,910 --> 00:17:12,760
<i>and the candelabra isn't 
going to last much longer.</i>

269
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:15,190
<i>Anastasia won't leave any openings.</i>

270
00:17:13,350 --> 00:17:13,890
Flop...

271
00:17:15,190 --> 00:17:18,680
<i>She's dead set on waiting until both 
my weapon and I are worn down.</i>

272
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:22,560
<i>But that will be when she exposes herself.</i>

273
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:24,350
<i>It'll be settled in an instant!</i>

274
00:17:27,610 --> 00:17:29,180
<i>The Silver Blader.</i>

275
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:34,610
<i>So proud, and beautiful, 
in service to her master...</i>

276
00:17:34,610 --> 00:17:37,450
<i>Such a splendid servant.</i>

277
00:17:38,770 --> 00:17:43,330
<i>As another dedicated to service, 
you are too brilliant for my eyes.</i>

278
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:48,220
<i>I... am ugly, and foul.</i>

279
00:17:50,090 --> 00:17:53,590
We're gonna get something good to eat.

280
00:17:54,060 --> 00:17:56,780
<i>I drove my master mad.</i>

281
00:17:57,980 --> 00:17:59,460
Anastasia...

282
00:18:00,300 --> 00:18:03,220
I don't resent you.

283
00:18:03,740 --> 00:18:06,370
If you want to turn back, 
this is your chance.

284
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:10,990
<i>That time has long passed.</i>

285
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:15,470
<i>Master Guitane... I will remain by your side,</i>

286
00:18:16,670 --> 00:18:19,930
<i>even if that's not what you want.</i>

287
00:18:21,490 --> 00:18:23,090
<i>I can hear</i>

288
00:18:23,090 --> 00:18:29,540
<i>how that candelabra in your hands is barely 
able to function as a metal stick anymore.</i>

289
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:32,370
<i>I'll at least do you the honor</i>

290
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:34,880
<i>of ending your life myself.</i>

291
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:57,330
Draconic Moon-Eater!

292
00:19:11,760 --> 00:19:15,090
Why didn't you kill me?

293
00:19:15,930 --> 00:19:20,830
That Luxa... you altered 
it to have a blunt edge.

294
00:19:21,340 --> 00:19:27,740
I had no idea... that you 
could use divine sorcery.

295
00:19:28,100 --> 00:19:32,740
It was a gift from my master.

296
00:19:33,710 --> 00:19:35,730
What's this glass ball?

297
00:19:35,990 --> 00:19:39,490
It's got the mana signature for Luxa on it!

298
00:19:39,490 --> 00:19:42,060
Just squeeze it and channel your mana,

299
00:19:42,060 --> 00:19:44,750
and it should take the shape 
of a Luxa to your liking.

300
00:19:44,750 --> 00:19:50,040
As happy as this makes me, 
I-I'm not very confident with mana...

301
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:52,740
I had intended to bring a sword with me...

302
00:19:52,740 --> 00:19:57,000
There's a chance the church might 
confiscate any weapons you try to bring.

303
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,890
Lloyd!

304
00:19:58,890 --> 00:20:01,500
Let's practice singing!

305
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:04,500
Well, if you don't end up 
needing it, all the better.

306
00:20:04,500 --> 00:20:05,900
P-Prince Lloyd!

307
00:20:10,870 --> 00:20:12,700
Thank you so much.

308
00:20:15,190 --> 00:20:21,100
My master is wise, impressive, and cute...

309
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:24,380
But still makes such blunders at times,

310
00:20:25,010 --> 00:20:28,100
and makes the most incredible 
faces when I scold him...

311
00:20:29,490 --> 00:20:31,860
He has no shortage of secrets.

312
00:20:32,660 --> 00:20:38,930
That said, I'm prepared to wait until 
he's ready to share them with me.

313
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:44,130
<i>Mana depletion? I really don't 
have much at all, do I?</i>

314
00:20:44,130 --> 00:20:46,250
<i>To be this exhausted from 
summoning a single sword...</i>

315
00:20:46,690 --> 00:20:47,900
I...

316
00:20:48,950 --> 00:20:51,940
would never dream... of scolding mine.

317
00:20:53,900 --> 00:20:58,220
<i>Even though... that may 
be what he longs for.</i>

318
00:20:58,940 --> 00:21:01,400
<i>For someone to stop him...</i>

319
00:21:05,550 --> 00:21:06,600
But...

320
00:21:07,590 --> 00:21:09,230
it can't be me.

321
00:21:12,730 --> 00:21:17,230
My voice can't reach him.

322
00:21:19,030 --> 00:21:21,020
Like the sky on a rainy night...

323
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:27,650
A cold abyss without a point of starlight... 
that's what his heart has become.

324
00:21:28,820 --> 00:21:31,850
Ever since... that day.

325
00:21:33,340 --> 00:21:37,570
All I can manage... 
is to serve as a hazy moon.

326
00:21:40,380 --> 00:21:45,220
As a simple maid, I'm in no 
position to judge either of you.

327
00:21:47,830 --> 00:21:49,730
I hope he hears it, though.

328
00:21:52,060 --> 00:21:55,570
<i>Maybe by the end of this battle...</i>

329
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:59,340
<i>someone's voice...</i>

330
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:02,670
<i>will reach your master.</i>

331
00:23:35,520 --> 00:23:42,230
<i>Sadly, defeating me will not prevent the 
kingdom from being swallowed by the darkness.</i>

332
00:23:42,660 --> 00:23:44,940
<i>Next time, on episode 22:</i>

333
00:23:44,690 --> 00:23:49,990
Episode 22

334
00:23:44,690 --> 00:23:49,990
Black Dragon

335
00:23:44,940 --> 00:23:46,060
"Black Dragon."

336
00:23:46,060 --> 00:23:49,450
<i>You will witness the depths of sorcery.</i>

